      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Mordekai muruudá' aa tleehharuut nguwa xuú', tlabaawós giri feehhamiís, guniyadu giri tsiít, tari sliík ar da/ara, iri waaraáhh ar baraá tla/ángw gixsa, /aa/eewo iri gáwtí tseé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám ina tláy ay dír afkú doó waawutmo, ala dahmu ngwaa aleeslayká, asma heé dahma gi aleesláw i kaahh afkú doó waawutmoowo bar guniyadu ngaa tsiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám umuúqo diiro baraá ayko hara'ayár waawutmo iwa hardát, slahh'amuú úr xoorór Yahudi guri sleér, tari gwaawín tari /aa/amín nee tari tsuunqumiís, tam múk yaariír guniyadu giri tsitiít nee tari qaqatín baraá da/ara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy sagadiyuusér Esta nee mukdá' ta karmuumuyi, Esta kari kángw Mordekai báy. Waawuto'o Esta iri ló'wa gurhaamút, Mordekai guri tlabií ya/áp as guniyaduudá' ngiwa hingeesi, ala inós iri sií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Esta Hataki guri atét, heé wák baraá mukdá' taa karmuumuyi oo doó waawutmo, oo taa ádbáy Esta ngiwa sagadiyuusi. Guri ya/áp amór Mordekai, áx gaa a milá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hataki iri tláy amór Mordekai dír afeenidár geeraá doó waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mordekai kangwdá' aa axaás guri alki/iít, nee peésaadá' Hamani aa al'axweés tidá' ta leehhi baraá tlakoó waawutmo as muk Yahudi kuwa qwaareesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mordekai Hataki guri gooidár qwaareesar'ín i haniís, tidá' taa ilahaniís baraá gixsár Susa, as ngiwa Esta i laqan nee ngiwa ádbay iwa amór waawutmoó keer, nguwa harhheehhe'es as mukós kuduú Yahudi nguwa gurtlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Hataki iri kií/ amór Esta, kangwdá' Mordekai aa alki/iít sleémeero guri oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Esta nee Hataki tari axweés, guri malé ya/áp amór Mordekai nguwa bay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Lawaale sleémeero ar waawutmo gan xú', tam múk ayeemaá waawutmo, adór umuúqo heewo, bar hhawaata laqaá /ameeni, oo aa amór waawutmoó kay barkwa ateetiiká dakko i deer, oo káh heé adoorí a gaasa, aqo har kudá' waawutmo aa hhartós ar sahaábúr looloqoós, tidár waawuti'iima, in hoot. Tam án taa ateetiiká niwa dah iimidá' ay laarí slahhaangw aa faák.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mordekai kway axweesanoó Está báy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mordekai inooín giri i axweés Esta kawa mu/aywatsi, giri báy, «Kiíng ma haraxuaar tawa /uur as tawa baraá doó waawutmówí diri' ta múk Yahudi kuquú hatlá' sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kiíng hamí bara xaslít, múk Yahudi ale/isaay nee ba/ama gin loohír hatlár sláy, kiíng tari qwát dinkwa nee múk doó baabuúwók, ala heé ga xuú' a heemá kiíng waawuti'iima gár kasa sleér tam an qoomár adór tí.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esta iri ya/abiín amór Mordekai as kuwa bay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tláw, múk Yahudi sleémeero oo diirír Susarí dirií' burumbureek, ta gwaawiindá' as aníng. Ma /ayimaara' laqaá ma gaa wahaara' har afiqoomár deelo tame, xweera nee tlaatla/aango. Aníng nee sagadiyuuser'eé' a gwaawimaán sleeme, daqaní niri dáh amór waawutmo adoodá' dabe i sla'aká, ar naa hamat bar gwa'ara ni gwaá'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mordekai iri tláy, tidá' sleémeero Esta ngwa beér, gari tleehhamór áy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
